abstract: >-
  Dated evidence snapshot for an unconfirmed 13.769-day transit candidate
  associated with KIC 5689121. Includes Kepler signal vetting, source attribution,
  archival follow-up, limitations, provenance and an RNAAS manuscript draft.
  Novelty and host identity remain provisional. No Zenodo DOI has yet been issued.
